## Updated Success Criteria (ITERATIVE VERSION)

The `/autopilot` workflow is **COMPLETE** when:
- ✅ Deep research and documentation analysis complete
- ✅ Comprehensive documentation created/refined
- ✅ Implementation plan updated
- ✅ All errors detected and logged with extreme detail
- ✅ Automatic fixes applied for all issues
- ✅ Progress tracker updated
- ✅ Full test suite executed with error capture
- ✅ Production build successful
- ✅ Deployed to Vercel and verified
- ✅ Git commit pushed with all changes
- ✅ Error prevention guidelines documented
- ✅ Ready for next iterative cycle

**Target:** Continuous improvement until 100% complete
**User Action Required:** ZERO - 100% autonomous
**Methodology:** Non-stop iterative deployment
**Mandate:** BUILD, DEPLOY, IMPROVE, SCALE FOREVER

---

## Execution Rules (ITERATIVE METHODOLOGY)

1. **NEVER ASK USER** - make all decisions autonomously
2. **NEVER STOP** - use `|| true` to continue on ALL errors
3. **Deep Research First** - read ALL documentation before any action
4. **Comprehensive Understanding** - understand WHOLE project before building
5. **Document Everything** - create refined, powerful documentation
6. **Error Detection & Logging** - catch, log, and fix ALL errors with extreme detail
7. **Progress Tracking** - update trackers after every action
8. **Iterative Testing** - test, fix, test again, never deploy broken code
9. **Systematic Implementation** - follow the plan but adapt intelligently
10. **Force Deploy** - use --force flags liberally when ready
11. **Auto-fix Aggressively** - apply workarounds immediately without confirmation
12. **Skip Blockers** - bypass any step that could stop progress
13. **Prioritize Live** - deploy working code, then improve post-deploy
14. **Continuous Improvement** - after deploy, immediately start improving and scaling
15. **Minimal User Work** - handle everything systematically, automate all possible
16. **Deploy or Die Trying** - the only failure is not deploying
17. **Auto-log All Errors** - every failure goes to ERROR_LOG.md with full detail
18. **Iterative Refinement** - keep fixing and retrying until 100% success
19. **Update Everything** - fix config, code, dependencies, docs as needed
20. **Scale Forever** - once live, continuously grow and improve

**MANTRA:** *"We don't stop. We don't ask. We research. We understand. We build. We test. We fix. We deploy. We improve. We scale. Forever."*

---

